Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.50,0:02:17.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（南卡罗来纳州）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:44.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.93,0:08:25.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（夏尔维尔特住宅区）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.26,0:12:26.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（克拉夫特伍德）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.04,0:15:33.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（避暑地）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是顾念所见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We look not at what can be seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是顾念所不见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we look at what cannot be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.73,0:00:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为所见的是暂时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what can be seen is temporary…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.49,0:00:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而所不见的是永远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what cannot be seen is eternal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.46,0:01:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们原知道 我们所居这地上的帐棚若被拆毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}For we know that if the earthly tent we live in is destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,必将得神所造\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have a building from God,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.13,0:01:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是人手所造\N{\fnArial\fs30}a house not made with hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.39,0:01:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在天堂永存的房屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}eternal in the heavens."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.43,0:01:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她本来要跟我一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was gonna come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.11,0:01:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在弗吉尼亚州的里士满城外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outside Richmond, Virginia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.01,0:01:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有围墙 房屋 20个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has a wall, homes, 20 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.75,0:01:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝本想跟他一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth wanted to go with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.23,0:01:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想送他去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted to get him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然路途遥远 但如果行得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a long trip, but if it works out,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.65,0:01:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会是我们最后一次长途跋涉\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's the last long trip we have to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是那里已经沦陷了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what if it isn't around anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:01:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,找一个新的安身之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we find a new place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在更好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.49,0:03:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.75,0:03:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,五英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.02,0:04:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.50,0:04:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.88,0:04:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经走了一半的路程 我想试试通话距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're halfway there. Just wanted to check the range.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.84,0:04:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家精神还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's holding tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.59,0:04:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,五百英里都走过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've made it 500 miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.80,0:04:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这次很容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this can be the easy part.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to think we're due.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.75,0:04:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们20分钟后回话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us 20 minutes to check in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.28,0:04:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有回话 我们就去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't hear from you, we'll come looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.55,0:04:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.33,0:04:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都想告诉你一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been wanting to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.94,0:04:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.83,0:04:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么做是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the right play.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,也起了作用 确实起作用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked. It did work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.76,0:04:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过之后发生了别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just something else happened after.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.22,0:04:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,该发生的总会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It went the way it had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.25,0:04:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,该发生的终会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way it was always going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前从未想杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never wanted to kill anybody before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.05,0:04:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've wanted that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.48,0:04:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也只是为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it just made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.23,0:04:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看不到我不想看到的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I didn't see anything except what I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.15,0:05:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有正视它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't facing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.30,0:05:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,正视什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Facing what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.15,0:05:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的事 现在的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened, what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.71,0:05:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲总是告诉萨沙和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad always told Sasha and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.42,0:05:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们作为世界公民 有责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it was our duty as citizens of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.07,0:05:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep up with the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.61,0:05:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小时候坐着他的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was little and I was in his car,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.15,0:05:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,广播里总会放那些新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}there were always those stories on the radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.83,0:05:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千英里外发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happens 1, 000 miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.85,0:05:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我们街区发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or down the block.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听都不敢听的恐怖事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of horror I couldn't even wrap my head around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.34,0:05:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他不换台\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he didn't change the channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.47,0:05:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.05,0:05:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就一直听\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just kept listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.51,0:05:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,正视它\N{\fnArial\fs30}To face it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,睁开双眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.87,0:05:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲总是称之为\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad always called that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.57,0:05:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,活着要付出的高昂代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}paying the high cost of living.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.18,0:05:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲在亚特兰大去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my dad in Atlanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.04,0:05:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他会喜欢你爸爸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he would have liked yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.94,0:06:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈和一对孪生兄弟还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still got a mom and a couple of twin brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.34,0:06:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望他们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.60,0:06:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.49,0:06:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有两英里就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two more miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.94,0:06:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在林子里停下 我们步行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's pull into the woods. We'll go on foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,避开大路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay off the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.23,0:06:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有这个必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.80,0:06:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.91,0:06:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,从林子外看 就像汽车残骸之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through the trees, it might just look like part of the wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.46,0:07:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是你们的人设下的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.44,0:07:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以前想设 一定是设好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanted to. They must have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.21,0:07:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.55,0:08:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.10,0:08:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有侦查员 狙击手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have spotters? Snipers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.32,0:08:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在一辆卡车上建了一个哨台\N{\fnArial\fs30}We built a perch on a truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.31,0:08:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时停在大门外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes it's out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天没在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.34,0:09:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.84,0:09:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.65,0:10:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.15,0:10:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.16,0:10:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.41,0:10:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以后和我们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be with us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.87,0:11:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.06,0:11:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾 诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.16,0:11:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,真心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I truly am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.88,0:11:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找点能用的东西就往回走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should see if there's anything we can use and head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.73,0:11:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.46,0:11:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们发现我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.33,0:11:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以快速扫荡一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make a quick sweep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里陪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.21,0:12:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔 收到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol, you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.06,0:12:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.12,0:12:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里沦陷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.86,0:12:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,干净的上衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.16,0:12:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会想出办法的 - 我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll figure it out. - We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.04,0:12:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,车库里有几个垃圾袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's some garbage bags in the garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.86,0:12:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没想到这里会沦陷吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't think it would still be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.86,0:12:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.15,0:12:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情发生之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After it happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.63,0:13:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在贝丝在医院被杀之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}right after with Beth in the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.75,0:13:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见那个女人道恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw that woman Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.27,0:13:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是故意的 我知道 我看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't mean to do it. I knew it. I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.69,0:13:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我想杀死她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I wanted to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.78,0:13:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得我当时在想 杀她或者不杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember I just wondered if it even mattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那么重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.49,0:13:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟贝丝一点关系都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't have a thing to do with Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.91,0:13:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不清楚我到底相不相信这里还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I thought it would still be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.76,0:13:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是贝丝想把他带到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Beth wanted to get him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.86,0:13:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想让他回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted to get him back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.43,0:13:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来这里是为了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.19,0:13:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准我们也可以住在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it could have been for us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要为我失去的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to die for what I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.94,0:14:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,和爱人去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who I had lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.74,0:14:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走到一群行尸当中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stepped out into a crowd of those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}just trying to…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.25,0:14:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,用它们来泄气\N{\fnArial\fs30}take it all out on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到它们杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}until they took me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.07,0:14:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它们挡在面前 这样我就能逃避现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put them all in front of me so I didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.72,0:14:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是继续前进了 所以之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just kept going. And then later,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当朱迪思需要我的时候我就在她身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there for Judith when she needed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.25,0:14:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.94,0:14:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,送她回到爸爸身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought her back to her dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.10,0:14:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我放弃了 一切都不会发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that wouldn't have happened if I had just given up…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.55,0:15:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没有选择继续活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I hadn't chosen to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.18,0:15:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.20,0:15:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并不是终点\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.09,0:15:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.00,0:15:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.56,0:15:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.92,0:15:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.22,0:15:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.55,0:15:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.54,0:15:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在想终点站集装箱里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking about that guy in the storage container,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.45,0:15:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}back at Terminus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.97,0:15:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是怎么让大家停下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How I made us stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.91,0:16:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开监狱之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.37,0:16:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在旅途中\N{\fnArial\fs30}on my trip,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.90,0:16:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又见到了玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got Maggie back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.83,0:16:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情都还说得过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things went okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.01,0:16:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去了华盛顿这个目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losing Washington…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.92,0:16:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}losing…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去了贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}losing Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.49,0:16:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚知道她还活着就失去了她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}right after just finding out she's alive…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.12,0:16:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我还没赶上你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hadn't caught up with you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.63,0:16:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果换做现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it were now,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.96,0:16:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让大家停下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't make us stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.14,0:16:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会径直走过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd run right by.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我会打死那个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would have shot that woman dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.98,0:16:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他对错呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然会在外面待太久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can be out here too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.59,0:17:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.48,0:17:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你最好别进去 - 我要进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't want to go in there. - Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.15,0:17:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.62,0:17:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打头阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.53,0:19:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我努力尽快赶回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to come back sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.84,0:19:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我努力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.77,0:19:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我按照你的话做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did what you told me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.07,0:20:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事的 坚持住 我去叫他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay. Just hold on. I'll get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.64,0:20:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去叫他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get… I'll get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.52,0:21:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少68名共和国公民\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least 68 citizens of The Republic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.77,0:21:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在对沿海主要地区的\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been killed in four deadly attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.26,0:21:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,四次致命袭击中被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}along the main coastal district.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军依然在滥用暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The group has continued their campaign of random violence,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,肆意地穿过乡村\N{\fnArial\fs30}moving across the countryside unfettered.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.57,0:21:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,而共和国军一片混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}with The Republic's military forces in disarray.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.25,0:21:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.57,0:21:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to tell you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.58,0:21:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,死的会是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was gonna be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.90,0:21:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是舍身救婴儿的那种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the kind of guy who saves babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.96,0:21:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得如果你爆了我的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Gareth would have been able to follow you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.98,0:21:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛瑞还能追踪到你们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you'd have just put a bullet in my brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.35,0:22:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者像你妹妹一样砍死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut me up like your sister did?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.25,0:22:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 别起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, whoa, whoa. Don't get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.07,0:22:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没告诉他们你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I hadn't told them that you were there,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.12,0:22:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许葛瑞就不会去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe Gareth wouldn't have gone after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.42,0:22:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们就不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they wouldn't be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.77,0:22:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许鲍勃就不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Bob wouldn't be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe him being alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.53,0:22:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如是这样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe something about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.61,0:22:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能贝丝的结局就会不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}would have changed things with Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.66,0:22:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,多米诺骨牌效应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Domino shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.36,0:22:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.67,0:22:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你现在就不会被咬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you wouldn't be bit right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.14,0:22:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 那是胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, that is bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.03,0:22:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在食品银行被咬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got bit at the food bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.48,0:22:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,该发生的总会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It went the way it had to,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.86,0:22:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,该发生的终会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}the way it was always going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.81,0:22:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像这次一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.91,0:22:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…然后夜袭了村庄\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then terrorizing the village by night,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.08,0:22:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,实施了报复行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}carrying out revenge attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.86,0:22:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中包括用刀砍无辜人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}involving hacking innocents with machetes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.27,0:22:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及用火烧某些无辜人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, in some cases, setting them on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.29,0:22:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you just did it,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.79,0:22:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你没有像个婊子一样撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you didn't lie like a bitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.77,0:23:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许就会改变一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}it might changed things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.03,0:23:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你就不用付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the bill would have been paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.47,0:23:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bill has to be paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.53,0:23:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须证明自己的价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to earn your keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.49,0:23:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉过我 只要能留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me you'd do whatever you had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.30,0:23:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,做什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}to earn your keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.52,0:23:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的原话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.95,0:23:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.59,0:23:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在更好了 泰尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better now, Tyreese.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.46,0:23:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.78,0:23:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在更好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.92,0:23:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在并没有更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.09,0:23:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很清楚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know damn well what…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.87,0:25:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以用几个车库门一起堵上缺口\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could put some of the garage doors together against the break.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.22,0:25:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,停一辆车堵住它们 直到我们把墙修起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Park a car against them until we can brick it back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.28,0:25:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,能行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can work.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.56,0:25:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方被一片森林包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is surrounded by a forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.50,0:25:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,视线不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no sight lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.55,0:25:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论是谁 或者什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever, whatever would.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.00,0:25:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,都可以神不知鬼不觉地袭击我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}be on top of us without us even knowing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.46,0:25:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那八成就是这里发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's probably what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.79,0:25:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是我们身上发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what happened to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.20,0:25:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以从砍树开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could start taking down the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.94,0:25:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用树来建墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We use them to build the walls up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.82,0:25:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.26,0:26:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.28,0:26:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.23,0:26:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you wondered if.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.94,0:26:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀不杀她到底重不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}it even mattered if you killed her or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.71,0:26:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是你杀了她 还是我或达里尔杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter if you had done it or if I had,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.07,0:26:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or that Daryl did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.38,0:26:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.83,0:27:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,华盛顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.26,0:27:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金在阻止灾变这件事上撒了谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene lied about a cure,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.24,0:27:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他想到华盛顿是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he thought of Washington for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.10,0:27:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他是在撒谎啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.12,0:27:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在阻止灾变上撒了谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the cure,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.97,0:27:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他仔细盘算过 并且意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he did the math and realized that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.25,0:27:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,华盛顿的生存机会最大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Washington was the place where there'd be a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.45,0:27:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离那里很近\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.80,0:27:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如那里有幸存者呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if there are people there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.48,0:27:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如那里有安全区呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it's someplace that we can be safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.72,0:27:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离那里只有一百英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're 100 miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.88,0:27:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个机遇 是个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a possibility. It's a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.15,0:27:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不像现在这样在外漂泊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of just being out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.75,0:27:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,勉强生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of just making it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.96,0:27:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为目前看来就是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because right now, this is what making it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.66,0:27:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不想带着希望多活一天吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you want one more day with a chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.72,0:27:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.09,0:28:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一百英里远\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 100 miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.00,0:28:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该去华盛顿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go to Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.92,0:28:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.34,0:28:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 瑞克 格伦 米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help, Rick! Glenn! Michonne!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.35,0:28:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.83,0:28:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.78,0:28:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来干掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.97,0:28:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.15,0:28:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是泰尔西 - 在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Tyreese! - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.61,0:28:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家 他被咬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My house. He's been bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.76,0:29:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,？每个人都有生存的权利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}?Every man has a right to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.31,0:29:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,？爱是我们所拥有的一切？\N{\fnArial\fs30}?Love is all that we have to give?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.77,0:29:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,？我们为了生存一起奋斗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}?Together we struggle by our will to survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.27,0:29:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,？我们为了幸存一起拼搏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}?And together we'll fight just to stay alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.78,0:29:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,？奋斗之人 必须前行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}?Struggling man has got to move?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.41,0:29:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,？奋斗之人 时不我待？\N{\fnArial\fs30}?Struggling man, no time to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.30,0:29:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,？我是个奋斗之人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}?I'm a struggling man?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.47,0:29:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,？而我必须前行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}?And I've got to move on?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.58,0:30:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 泰尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Tyreese.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.85,0:30:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在应该懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta know that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.02,0:30:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想继续参与也没事 泰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay that you didn't want to be a part of it anymore, Ty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.24,0:30:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要非得参与\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.78,0:30:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 这就是你的问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that's your problem right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.81,0:30:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's my problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.84,0:30:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想参与其中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't want to be part of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.79,0:30:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但活着就是参与\N{\fnArial\fs30}but being part of it is being now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.24,0:30:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.54,0:30:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,睁眼看清楚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.97,0:30:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要参与 如果你不想参与的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to. Not if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.34,0:30:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的没必要 现在这样更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't. It's better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.80,0:30:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你会证明你的价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me you'd earn your keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.22,0:31:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那时候不知道自己在说什么 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had no idea what you were talking about, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.50,0:31:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.19,0:31:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你睁着眼睛 却不想去看清现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eyes were open, but you didn't want to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.78,0:31:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便我早就逼你去看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though I made you see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.53,0:31:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都给你看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I showed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.86,0:31:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你听进去了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But did you adapt?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.12,0:31:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你改变了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you change?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.87,0:31:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.11,0:31:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却坐在一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you would sit there in front of a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.48,0:31:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了你爱人的女人面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}who killed someone you loved…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.44,0:31:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你原谅了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you would forgive her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.03,0:31:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.72,0:31:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.08,0:31:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.55,0:32:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我在跟谁说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know who I was talking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.51,0:32:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了只要能留下来 我做什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I would do what I had to to earn my keep,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.36,0:32:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不知道你的真面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I didn't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.55,0:32:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.55,0:32:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.67,0:32:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道过去发生了什么 现在又是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what happened and what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.58,0:32:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.22,0:32:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都没给我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't show me shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.27,0:32:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.69,0:32:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything that you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.22,0:32:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,都已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.01,0:32:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.15,0:32:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切还没结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.08,0:32:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原谅她是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgave her because…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.49,0:32:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都还没结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.29,0:32:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都没结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.57,0:32:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切 一切都没结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… it's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.63,0:33:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有逃避现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't turn away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.70,0:33:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在听新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kept listening to the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.24,0:33:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我就能尽我所能去帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I could do what I could to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.70,0:33:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.74,0:33:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.78,0:33:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not giving up!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.79,0:33:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People like me…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.94,0:33:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我这样的人 他们能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}people like me, they can live.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.75,0:33:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天任何人都不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't nobody got to die today.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.21,0:33:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to pay the bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.44,0:34:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你按住他 - 好了 上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You hold him! - I got it! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.34,0:34:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一刀 干净利落 砍\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hit, clean! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.44,0:34:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.33,0:34:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.28,0:34:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 从后面走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go! - Through the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.86,0:34:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,得把锁链砸断\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to break the chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.61,0:34:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.19,0:35:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们用球棒 - 我扶他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can use the bat. - I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.31,0:35:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把他扶住吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hold him up?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.36,0:35:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.97,0:35:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.10,0:35:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一二三 起\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.83,0:35:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 假如你真这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, if you believe that,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.32,0:35:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那死的人一定是你和那个小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}then it's definitely gonna be you and the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.28,0:36:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 别管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No… - Leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.95,0:36:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扶着他 保持清醒 保持清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him. Stay with us, now. Stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.08,0:36:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to pay the bill!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.83,0:36:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扶着你 慢点 慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you. Easy now, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.86,0:36:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 一二三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, one, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.89,0:36:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Wait, wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.34,0:36:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.37,0:36:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,睁眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open them!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.13,0:36:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托老兄 睁开眼睛 睁开眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. Open your eyes. Open your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.10,0:36:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,该发生的总会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It went the way it had to,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.45,0:36:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,该发生的终会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}the way it was always going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.84,0:36:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须坚持住 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to hold on, man. Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.49,0:37:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抬他的腿 - 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}- His feet! Get his feet. - Two, three…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.58,0:37:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.69,0:37:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 把他递给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, give him to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.87,0:37:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抬他进来 - 我扶住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bring him in. - I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.92,0:37:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 扶他坐起来 - 你没事的 你没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold him up. - You're all right. You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.93,0:37:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔 我们上车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol, we're at the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.67,0:37:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要灼烧和包扎伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to cauterize the arm and wrap it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.51,0:37:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,支走萨沙和卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Sasha and Carl away.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.45,0:37:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没必要看到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't need to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.46,0:37:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.50,0:38:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.51,0:38:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,据报道 在共和国交通走廊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There have been troubling reports of cannibalism.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.46,0:38:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,附近的难民营出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}having broken out in refugee camps.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.77,0:38:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人不安的食人现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}along the republic's transportation corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.12,0:38:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管叛军取得了一系列胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}And despite the string of victories by rebel forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.01,0:38:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有报告显示他们的战术愈发残忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are disturbing reports of increasing the brutality of their tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.47,0:38:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括对村庄的大规模破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}including the wholesale destruction of villages,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.18,0:38:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧毁当地监狱 伤害平民\N{\fnArial\fs30}burning down local prisons, targeting of civilians,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.56,0:38:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至将孩子和年轻母亲断肢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and even the widespread mutilation of children and young mothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.73,0:38:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这看起来只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this seems like only the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.69,0:38:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们所谓的无尽战争的开始…\N{\fnArial\fs30}of their campaign that they label as an endless war against…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.37,0:38:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.51,0:38:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.78,0:39:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 泰尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Tyreese.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.06,0:39:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在应该懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta know that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.11,0:39:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't just okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.52,0:39:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在更好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.90,0:41:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是顾念所见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We look not at what can be seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.36,0:41:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是顾念所不见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we look at what cannot be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.67,0:41:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为所见的是暂时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what can be seen is temporary,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.53,0:41:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所不见的是永远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what cannot be seen is eternal.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.11,0:41:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们原知道 我们这地上的帐棚若拆毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For we know that if the earthly tent we live in is destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.84,0:41:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,必将得神所造\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have a building from God,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.01,0:41:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是人手所造\N{\fnArial\fs30}a house not made from hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.11,0:41:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在天堂永存的房屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}eternal in the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.22,0:41:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the heavens."
